#: src/getting-started/installation.md:80
msgid ""
"The Linux **glibc** binaries are built against a glibc 2.31 sysroot, so they "
"require **glibc ≥ 2.31**. This includes Ubuntu 20.04+, Debian 11+, RHEL 9+ "
"and Amazon Linux 2023. Release CI checks the compiler's imported glibc "
"symbol versions and exercises a compiled program inside that environment."
msgstr ""
