#: src/language/supported-features.md:575
msgid "JSX/TSX"
msgstr "JSX/TSX"

#: src/language/supported-features.md:577
msgid ""
"Perry's parser and HIR understand JSX syntax (parsed via SWC, lowered in "
"`crates/perry-hir/src/jsx.rs`) and `.tsx` files link through Perry's built-"
"in `jsx()` / `jsxs()` runtime path. You do not need a local `react/jsx-"
"runtime` package just to compile TSX."
msgstr ""
"Il parser e l'HIR di Perry comprendono la sintassi JSX (analizzata tramite "
"SWC, abbassata in `crates/perry-hir/src/jsx.rs`) e i file `.tsx` si "
"collegano attraverso il percorso runtime integrato `jsx()` / `jsxs()` di "
"Perry. Non è necessario un pacchetto locale `react/jsx-runtime` solo per "
"compilare TSX."

#: src/language/supported-features.md:582
msgid ""
"```tsx\n"
"import { Box, Text } from \"perry/tui\";\n"
"\n"
"function Greeting({ name }: { name: string }) {\n"
"  return <Text>{`Hello, ${name}!`}</Text>;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"const page = <div className=\"card\"><Greeting name=\"Perry\" /></div>;\n"
"const app = <Box><Greeting name=\"TUI\" /></Box>;\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```tsx\n"
"import { Box, Text } from \"perry/tui\";\n"
"\n"
"function Greeting({ name }: { name: string }) {\n"
"  return <Text>{`Hello, ${name}!`}</Text>;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"const page = <div className=\"card\"><Greeting name=\"Perry\" /></div>;\n"
"const app = <Box><Greeting name=\"TUI\" /></Box>;\n"
"```"

#: src/language/supported-features.md:593
msgid ""
"JSX elements are transformed to function calls via the `jsx()` / `jsxs()` "
"runtime. Perry's built-in adapter supports HTML-style intrinsic tags, "
"fragments, function components, and compile-time rewrites for `perry/tui` "
"`Box` / `Text` so those TUI JSX forms lower to the same native builders as "
"the function-call form."
msgstr ""
"Gli elementi JSX vengono trasformati in chiamate a funzioni tramite il "
"runtime `jsx()` / `jsxs()`. L'adattatore integrato di Perry supporta tag "
"intrinseci in stile HTML, frammenti, componenti funzione e riscritture in "
"fase di compilazione per `Box` / `Text` di `perry/tui`, così quelle forme "
"JSX TUI vengono abbassate agli stessi builder nativi della forma a chiamata "
"di funzione."

#: src/language/supported-features.md:599
msgid ""
"Caveat: this is Perry's TSX runtime, not React DOM or full React reconciler "
"semantics. For `perry/ui`, or for `perry/tui` intrinsics whose JSX rewrite "
"has not landed yet, the function-call form remains the canonical native API."
msgstr ""
"Avvertenza: questo è il runtime TSX di Perry, non React DOM né la semantica "
"completa del reconciler React. Per `perry/ui`, o per gli intrinseci `perry/"
"tui` la cui riscrittura JSX non è ancora disponibile, la forma a chiamata di "
"funzione rimane l'API nativa canonica."

#: src/language/supported-features.md:603
msgid "JavaScript (`.js`) Input"
msgstr "JavaScript (`.js`) Input"

#: src/language/supported-features.md:605
msgid ""
"Perry is a TypeScript compiler, but TypeScript is a superset of JavaScript — "
"so Perry also compiles plain JavaScript. `.js`, `.cjs`, `.mjs`, and `.jsx` "
"files are parsed as JavaScript (decorators, JSX, and import attributes "
"enabled) and lowered through the exact same native pipeline as `.ts`. No "
"type annotations are required."
msgstr ""
"Perry è un compilatore TypeScript, ma TypeScript è un superset di JavaScript "
"e Perry compila anche JavaScript. I file `.js`, `.cjs`, `.mjs` e `.jsx` "
"vengono analizzati come JavaScript (decoratori, JSX e attributi di "
"importazione abilitati) e abbassati attraverso la stessa pipeline nativa di "
"`.ts`. Non sono richieste annotazioni di tipo."

#: src/language/supported-features.md:615
msgid ""
"There are no guarantees for every dynamic JavaScript pattern (the "
"[Limitations](limitations.md) still apply — no `eval`, no general dynamic "
"`require()`), but most plain JavaScript projects compile and run."
msgstr ""
"Non ci sono garanzie per ogni modello JavaScript dinamico (la [Limitations]"
"(limitations.md) ancora non applica `eval`, nessuna dinamica generale "
"`require()`), ma la maggior parte dei progetti JavaScript semplici compilare "
"ed eseguire."

#: src/language/supported-features.md:619
msgid "Node.js Compatibility"
msgstr "Node.js Compatibility"

#: src/language/supported-features.md:621
msgid ""
"Perry implements a large, real (non-stub) slice of the Node.js standard "
"library — `fs`, `http`/`https`/`http2`, `net`/`tls`, `dns`/`dgram`, "
"`crypto`, `stream` (+ `stream/web`), `events`, `child_process`, `cluster`, "
"`worker_threads`, `zlib`, `process`, `async_hooks` / `AsyncLocalStorage`, "
"`Atomics` / `SharedArrayBuffer`, and the WHATWG web globals (`fetch`, `URL`, "
"streams, `structuredClone`, WebCrypto, …). Against Node's own test suite "
"(node v26, 53 `node:*` modules) Perry passes ~97% of cases, with overall "
"Node/TypeScript compatibility around 95%. The per-module surface and "
"remaining gaps are tracked in `docs/runtime-parity-gaps.md`."
msgstr ""
"Perry implementa una grossa, reale fetta (non-stub) della Node.js libreria "
"standard `fs`, `http`/`https`/`http2`, `net`/`tls`, `dns`/`dgram`, `crypto`, "
"`stream` (+ `stream/web`), `events`, `child_process`, `cluster`, "
"`worker_threads`, `zlib`, `process`, `async_hooks` / `AsyncLocalStorage`, "
"`Atomics` / `SharedArrayBuffer`, e il web global WHATWG (`fetch`, `URL`, "
"flussi, `structuredClone`, WebCrypto, ...). Contro la propria suite di test "
"di Node (node v26, 53 moduli `node:*`) Perry passa ~97% dei casi, con "
"compatibilità totale Node/TypeScript circa 95%. La superficie per modulo e "
"gli spazi vuoti rimanenti sono tracciati in `docs/runtime-parity-gaps.md`."

#: src/language/supported-features.md:633
msgid "[Type System](type-system.md) — Type inference and checking"
msgstr "[Sistema dei tipi](type-system.md) — Inferenza e controllo dei tipi"

#: src/language/supported-features.md:634
msgid "[Limitations](limitations.md) — What's not supported yet"
msgstr "[Limitazioni](limitations.md) — Cosa non è ancora supportato"

#: src/language/type-system.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry erases types at compile time, similar to how `tsc` removes type "
"annotations when emitting JavaScript. However, Perry also performs type "
"inference to generate efficient native code."
msgstr ""
"Perry cancella i tipi in fase di compilazione, in modo simile a come `tsc` "
"rimuove le annotazioni di tipo quando emette JavaScript. Tuttavia, Perry "
"esegue anche l'inferenza dei tipi per generare codice nativo efficiente."

#: src/language/type-system.md:5
msgid "Type Inference"
msgstr "Inferenza dei tipi"

#: src/language/type-system.md:7
msgid "Perry infers types from expressions without requiring annotations:"
msgstr "Perry inferisce i tipi dalle espressioni senza richiedere annotazioni:"

#: src/language/type-system.md:9
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"function inferenceBasics(): void {\n"
"    let x = 5;           // inferred as number\n"
"    let s = \"hello\";     // inferred as string\n"
"    let b = true;        // inferred as boolean\n"
"    let arr = [1, 2, 3]; // inferred as number[]\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`inference: x=${x} s=${s} b=${b} arr_len=${arr.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"function inferenceBasics(): void {\n"
"    let x = 5;           // inferred as number\n"
"    let s = \"hello\";     // inferred as string\n"
"    let b = true;        // inferred as boolean\n"
"    let arr = [1, 2, 3]; // inferred as number[]\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`inference: x=${x} s=${s} b=${b} arr_len=${arr.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/language/type-system.md:20
msgid "Inference works through:"
msgstr "L'inferenza funziona attraverso:"

#: src/language/type-system.md:21
msgid "**Literal values**: `5` → `number`, `\"hi\"` → `string`"
msgstr "**Valori letterali**: `5` → `number`, `\"hi\"` → `string`"

#: src/language/type-system.md:22
msgid "**Binary operations**: `a + b` where both are numbers → `number`"
msgstr "**Operazioni binarie**: `a + b` dove entrambi sono numeri → `number`"

#: src/language/type-system.md:23
msgid ""
"**Variable propagation**: if `x` is `number`, then `let y = x` is `number`"
msgstr ""
"**Propagazione delle variabili**: se `x` è `number`, allora `let y = x` è "
"`number`"

#: src/language/type-system.md:24
msgid ""
"**Method returns**: `\"hello\".trim()` → `string`, `[1,2].length` → `number`"
msgstr ""
"**Valori di ritorno dei metodi**: `\"hello\".trim()` → `string`, "
"`[1,2].length` → `number`"

#: src/language/type-system.md:25
msgid ""
"**Function returns**: user-defined function return types are propagated to "
"callers"
msgstr ""
"**Valori di ritorno delle funzioni**: i tipi di ritorno delle funzioni "
"definite dall'utente sono propagati ai chiamanti"

#: src/language/type-system.md:27
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"function inferenceFunction(): void {\n"
"    function double(n: number): number {\n"
"        return n * 2;\n"
"    }\n"
"    let result = double(5); // inferred as number\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`inference-function: result=${result}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"function inferenceFunction(): void {\n"
"    function double(n: number): number {\n"
"        return n * 2;\n"
"    }\n"
"    let result = double(5); // inferred as number\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`inference-function: result=${result}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/language/type-system.md:38
msgid "Type Annotations"
msgstr "Annotazioni di tipo"

#: src/language/type-system.md:40
msgid "Standard TypeScript annotations work:"
msgstr "Le annotazioni standard di TypeScript funzionano:"

#: src/language/type-system.md:42
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"interface Config {\n"
"    port: number;\n"
"    host: string;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"function annotations(): void {\n"
"    let name: string = \"Perry\";\n"
"    let count: number = 0;\n"
"    let items: string[] = [];\n"
"\n"
"    function greet(name: string): string {\n"
"        return `Hello, ${name}`;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    const cfg: Config = { port: 8080, host: \"localhost\" }\n"
"    console.log(`annotations: ${greet(name)} count=${count} items=$"
"{items.length} port=${cfg.port}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"interface Config {\n"
"    port: number;\n"
"    host: string;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"function annotations(): void {\n"
"    let name: string = \"Perry\";\n"
"    let count: number = 0;\n"
"    let items: string[] = [];\n"
"\n"
"    function greet(name: string): string {\n"
"        return `Hello, ${name}`;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    const cfg: Config = { port: 8080, host: \"localhost\" }\n"
"    console.log(`annotations: ${greet(name)} count=${count} items=$"
"{items.length} port=${cfg.port}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/language/type-system.md:62
msgid "Utility Types"
msgstr "Utility Types"

#: src/language/type-system.md:64
msgid ""
"Common TypeScript utility types are erased at compile time (they don't "
"affect code generation):"
msgstr ""
"Gli utility types comuni di TypeScript vengono cancellati in fase di "
"compilazione (non influiscono sulla generazione del codice):"

#: src/language/type-system.md:75
msgid ""
"These are all recognized and erased — they won't cause compilation errors."
msgstr ""
"Questi sono tutti riconosciuti e cancellati — non causeranno errori di "
"compilazione."

#: src/language/type-system.md:77
msgid "Generics"
msgstr "Generics"

#: src/language/type-system.md:79
msgid "Generic type parameters are erased:"
msgstr "I parametri di tipo generici vengono cancellati:"

#: src/language/type-system.md:81
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"function identity<T>(value: T): T {\n"
"    return value;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"class Box<T> {\n"
"    value: T;\n"
"    constructor(value: T) {\n"
"        this.value = value;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"function genericsDemo(): void {\n"
"    const box = new Box<number>(42);\n"
"    const id = identity<string>(\"hello\")\n"
"    console.log(`generics: box.value=${box.value} id=${id}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"function identity<T>(value: T): T {\n"
"    return value;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"class Box<T> {\n"
"    value: T;\n"
"    constructor(value: T) {\n"
"        this.value = value;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"function genericsDemo(): void {\n"
"    const box = new Box<number>(42);\n"
"    const id = identity<string>(\"hello\")\n"
"    console.log(`generics: box.value=${box.value} id=${id}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/language/type-system.md:100
msgid ""
"At runtime, all values are NaN-boxed — the generic parameter doesn't affect "
"code generation."
msgstr ""
"A runtime, tutti i valori sono NaN-boxed — il parametro generico non "
"influisce sulla generazione del codice."

#: src/language/type-system.md:102
msgid "Type Checking with `--type-check`"
msgstr "Controllo dei tipi con `--type-check`"

#: src/language/type-system.md:104
msgid ""
"For stricter type checking, Perry can integrate with Microsoft's TypeScript "
"checker:"
msgstr ""
"Per un controllo dei tipi più rigoroso, Perry può integrarsi con il checker "
"TypeScript di Microsoft:"

#: src/language/type-system.md:110
msgid ""
"This resolves cross-file types, interfaces, and generics via an IPC "
"protocol. It falls back gracefully if the type checker is not installed."
msgstr ""
"Questo risolve tipi, interfacce e generics tra file tramite un protocollo "
"IPC. Se il type checker non è installato, viene gestito un fallback elegante."

#: src/language/type-system.md:112
msgid ""
"Without `--type-check`, Perry relies on its own inference engine, which "
"handles common patterns but doesn't perform full TypeScript type checking."
msgstr ""
"Senza `--type-check`, Perry si affida al proprio motore di inferenza, che "
"gestisce i pattern comuni ma non esegue il controllo dei tipi TypeScript "
"completo."

#: src/language/type-system.md:114
msgid "Union and Intersection Types"
msgstr "Tipi unione e intersezione"

#: src/language/type-system.md:116
msgid ""
"Union types are recognized syntactically but don't affect code generation:"
msgstr ""
"I tipi unione vengono riconosciuti sintatticamente ma non influiscono sulla "
"generazione del codice:"

#: src/language/type-system.md:118
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"type StringOrNumber = string | number;\n"
"\n"
"function process(value: StringOrNumber) {\n"
"    if (typeof value === \"string\") {\n"
"        console.log(value.toUpperCase());\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        console.log(value + 1);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"type StringOrNumber = string | number;\n"
"\n"
"function process(value: StringOrNumber) {\n"
"    if (typeof value === \"string\") {\n"
"        console.log(value.toUpperCase());\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        console.log(value + 1);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/language/type-system.md:130
msgid "Use `typeof` checks for runtime type narrowing."
msgstr "Usa i controlli `typeof` per il narrowing dei tipi a runtime."

#: src/language/type-system.md:132
msgid "Type Guards"
msgstr "Type Guards"

#: src/language/type-system.md:134
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"function isString(value: any): value is string {\n"
"    return typeof value === \"string\";\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"function typeGuardsDemo(): void {\n"
"    const x: any = \"hello\"\n"
"    if (isString(x)) {\n"
"        console.log(x.toUpperCase());\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"function isString(value: any): value is string {\n"
"    return typeof value === \"string\";\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"function typeGuardsDemo(): void {\n"
"    const x: any = \"hello\"\n"
"    if (isString(x)) {\n"
"        console.log(x.toUpperCase());\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/language/type-system.md:147
msgid ""
"The `value is string` annotation is erased, but the `typeof` check works at "
"runtime."
msgstr ""
"L'annotazione `value is string` viene cancellata, ma il controllo `typeof` "
"funziona a runtime."

