#: src/ui/styling.md:184
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const colored = Text(\"Colored text\")\n"
"textSetColor(colored, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0)              // r, g, b, a in "
"[0,1]\n"
"widgetSetBackgroundColor(colored, 0.94, 0.94, 0.94, 1.0)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
