#: src/platforms/windows.md:115
msgid ""
"The linker couldn't find the Windows SDK libraries. Perry probes the "
"registry (`KitsRoot10`) and the standard `Windows "
"Kits\\10\\Lib\\<ver>\\um\\x64` install paths; when the probe fails it prints "
"a warning listing the paths it tried. Fixes, in order of preference:"
msgstr ""
