msgstr "[Threading](../threading/overview.md) — Threading con Web Worker"

#: src/stdlib/overview.md:1
msgid "Standard Library Overview"
msgstr "Panoramica della Libreria Standard"

#: src/stdlib/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry compiles supported npm packages and Node.js APIs to native code — no "
"JavaScript runtime involved. Shared runtime APIs have native "
"implementations; ordinary JavaScript and TypeScript dependencies should be "
"compiled from their upstream source."
msgstr ""
"Perry compila pacchetti npm supportati e API Node.js al codice nativo και "
"nessun runtime JavaScript coinvolto. Le API di runtime condivise hanno "
"implementazioni native; le dipendenze ordinarie di JavaScript e TypeScript "
"dovrebbero essere compilate dal loro sorgente upstream."

#: src/stdlib/overview.md:10
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import fastify from \"fastify\"\n"
"import mysql from \"mysql2/promise\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import fastify from \"fastify\"\n"
"import mysql from \"mysql2/promise\"\n"
"```"

#: src/stdlib/overview.md:15
msgid ""
"Perry recognizes these imports at compile time. Today, many route to "
"standalone `perry-ext-*` Rust compatibility shims backed by the stable "
"[`perry-ffi` ABI](../native-libraries/abi.md); a few older Node.js built-ins "
"still live in `perry-stdlib`. These shims expose documented supported "
"surfaces and remain available during migration, but most ordinary packages "
"are intended to move to upstream-source compilation. See the [binding "
"governance inventory](../native-libraries/governance.md) for each crate's "
"disposition and [zero-config bindings and faithfulness](../native-libraries/"
"zero-config-and-faithfulness.md) for compatibility guarantees."
msgstr ""
"Perry riconosce queste importazioni al momento della compilazione. Oggi, "
"molti percorsi per standalone `perry-ext-*` Rust compatibility shims "
"supportati dalla stabile [`perry-ffi` ABI](../native-libraries/abi.md); "
"alcuni vecchi Node.js built-in ancora in diretta in `perry-stdlib`. Questi "
"shim espongono superfici documentate supportate e rimangono disponibili "
"durante la migrazione, ma la maggior parte dei pacchetti ordinari sono "
"destinati a passare alla compilazione upstream-source. Vedere [inventario "
"vincolante della governance](../native-libraries/governance.md) per ogni "
"disposizione della cassa e [legature zero-config e fedeltà](../native-"
"libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md) per garanzie di compatibilità."

