#: src/container/volumes.md:73
msgid ""
"Best-effort: hosts where the source path doesn't exist (e.g. some minimal "
"Alpine VMs) just see a missing mount source — docker tolerates it; the "
"container falls back to UTC / system defaults."
msgstr ""
"Best-effort: sugli host in cui il percorso sorgente non esiste (es. alcune "
"VM Alpine minimali) si vedrà semplicemente una sorgente di mount mancante — "
"docker lo tollera; il container torna a UTC / impostazioni predefinite di "
"sistema."

#: src/container/volumes.md:77
msgid "Preservation on `down()`"
msgstr "Preservazione al momento di `down()`"

#: src/container/volumes.md:79
msgid "By default, **`down(handle)` preserves named volumes**:"
msgstr ""
"Per impostazione predefinita, **`down(handle)` preserva i volumi con nome**:"

#: src/container/volumes.md:81
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"await down(stack);                       // containers + networks gone, "
"volumes survive\n"
"await down(stack, { volumes: false });   // same — explicit preserve\n"
"await down(stack, { volumes: true });    // ⚠ volumes ALSO removed (DESTROYS "
"DATA)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"await down(stack);                       // containers + networks gone, "
"volumes survive\n"
"await down(stack, { volumes: false });   // same — explicit preserve\n"
"await down(stack, { volumes: true });    // ⚠ volumes ALSO removed (DESTROYS "
"DATA)\n"
"```"

