"can supply `--app-bundle-id` from its `// widget-bundle-id:` banner ([\\#194]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/194)). An end-to-end target build "
"still needs an Android NDK and the Wear OS Gradle dependencies. The shared "
"snippet on this page requests the host compile/link check only."
