"1=action / 2=waterfall.\n"
"    api.registerHookEx(\"beforeSave\", validate, 10, 0)   // Runs first\n"
"    api.registerHookEx(\"beforeSave\", transform, 20, 0)  // Runs second\n"
"    api.registerHookEx(\"beforeSave\", log, 100, 1)        // Runs last "
"(action mode)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

