msgid ""
"Finds a registered menu item whose shortcut matches and fires its callback. "
"Shortcut strings are case-insensitive and match the key string passed to "
"`menuAddItem` (e.g., `\"s\"` for Cmd+S, `\"S\"` for Cmd+Shift+S, `\"n\"` for "
"Cmd+N)."
msgstr ""
