msgstr "Crea una Bitmap, comprime in PNG"

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:262
msgid "`WidgetPaintable` + `GskRenderer`"
msgstr "`WidgetPaintable` + `GskRenderer`"

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:262
