"`perry.nativeLibrary` / `compilePackages`. Lockdown refuses _any_ "
"nativeLibrary reference, no allow-list needed."
msgstr ""
"[`#497`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/497) — allowlist dell'host "
"per `perry.nativeLibrary` / `compilePackages`. Il lockdown rifiuta "
"_qualsiasi_ riferimento a nativeLibrary, senza necessità di una allow-list."

#: src/cli/lockdown.md:84
