#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:159
msgid ""
"CPU baseline for the generated machine code: an LLVM CPU name (`\"x86-64-"
"v2\"`, `\"x86-64-v3\"`, `\"znver2\"`, `\"apple-m1\"`, …), `\"native\"` (tune "
"to the build machine's full instruction set), or `\"generic\"` (the target "
"architecture's portable baseline). Pin this when the binary runs on machines "
"other than the build box — an unpinned host-native build on an AVX-512 "
"machine crashes with SIGILL on older x86-64 CPUs. Equivalent to `--march` / "
"`PERRY_TARGET_CPU`."
msgstr ""
"CPU baseline per il codice macchina generato: un nome CPU LLVM (`\"x86-64-"
"v2\"`, `\"x86-64-v3\"`, `\"znver2\"`, `\"apple-m1\"`, ...), `\"native\"` "
"(tune to the build machine's full instruction set), o `\"generic\"` (the "
"target architecture's portatile baseline). Pin questo quando il binario "
"funziona su macchine diverse dalla build box di un host-native non pinned "
"costruito su una macchina AVX-512 si blocca con SIGILL su vecchie CPU "
"x86-64. Equivalente a `--march` / `PERRY_TARGET_CPU`."

