"helpers; a library spreads objects into objects, boxes every mutable capture "
"because its closures outlive their frames, and builds values field by field "
"out of data. **The rooting hazards live in the shapes**, so a corpus without "
"the shapes cannot express them however many files it has."
msgstr ""
