#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:168
msgid ""
"Death pruning moves finalizer records into a native pending queue. It does "
"not call addon code while the collector is marking, rewriting, sweeping, or "
"holding an arena borrow. The next main-thread safepoint drains the queue "
"inside an implicit handle scope with `can_call_into_js = true`. That is the "
"stable version-8 `napi_finalize` contract and is why finalizer invocation "
"depends on the completed native-to-JavaScript callback boundary. The "
"experimental `node_api_basic_env` restriction and `node_api_post_finalizer` "
"pairing are deferred with the rest of that experimental surface."
msgstr ""
"La potatura della morte sposta i record finalizzatori in una coda nativa in "
